"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"58-df-ring\">58-df-ring</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Laurent}_S:V^6\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{Laurent}_S:V^6\\to V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Laurent}_S(A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A;\\epsilon)\\in V\">\\(\\operatorname{Laurent}_S(A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A;\\epsilon)\\in V\\)</span> (set-coded Laurent-series carrier defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PolePart}_\\epsilon,\\operatorname{SeriesNeg}_\\epsilon:\\operatorname{Laurent}_S(A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A;\\epsilon)\\to\\operatorname{Laurent}_S(A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A;\\epsilon)\">\\(\\operatorname{PolePart}_\\epsilon,\\operatorname{SeriesNeg}_\\epsilon:\\operatorname{Laurent}_S(A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A;\\epsilon)\\to\\operatorname{Laurent}_S(A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A;\\epsilon)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SeriesAdd}_\\epsilon:\\operatorname{Laurent}_S(A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A;\\epsilon)^2\\to\\operatorname{Laurent}_S(A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A;\\epsilon)\">\\(\\operatorname{SeriesAdd}_\\epsilon:\\operatorname{Laurent}_S(A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A;\\epsilon)^2\\to\\operatorname{Laurent}_S(A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A;\\epsilon)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FinitePart}_\\epsilon:\\operatorname{Laurent}_S(A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A;\\epsilon)\\to A\">\\(\\operatorname{FinitePart}_\\epsilon:\\operatorname{Laurent}_S(A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A;\\epsilon)\\to A\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MinimalSubtraction}_S\\subseteq V^8\\land\\operatorname{CountertermRenormalized}_S\\subseteq V^9\">\\(\\operatorname{MinimalSubtraction}_S\\subseteq V^8\\land\\operatorname{CountertermRenormalized}_S\\subseteq V^9\\)</span> (predicates with coefficient-ring structure explicit)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}renormalization\\text{-}laurent} \\vdash \\operatorname{Laurent}_S(A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A;\\epsilon)\\coloneqq\\left\\{a\\in V:\\mathrm{Function}(a,\\mathbb Z,A)\\land\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(n&lt;-N\\to a(n)=0_A)\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}renormalization\\text{-}laurent} \\vdash \\operatorname{Laurent}_S(A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A;\\epsilon)\\coloneqq\\left\\{a\\in V:\\mathrm{Function}(a,\\mathbb Z,A)\\land\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(n&lt;-N\\to a(n)=0_A)\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}renormalization\\text{-}pole} \\vdash \\operatorname{PolePart}_\\epsilon(a)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle n,c\\rangle\\in\\mathbb Z\\times A:(n&lt;0\\land c=a(n))\\lor(0\\leq n\\land c=0_A)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}renormalization\\text{-}pole} \\vdash \\operatorname{PolePart}_\\epsilon(a)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle n,c\\rangle\\in\\mathbb Z\\times A:(n&lt;0\\land c=a(n))\\lor(0\\leq n\\land c=0_A)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}renormalization\\text{-}finite} \\vdash \\operatorname{FinitePart}_\\epsilon(a)\\coloneqq a(0)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}renormalization\\text{-}finite} \\vdash \\operatorname{FinitePart}_\\epsilon(a)\\coloneqq a(0)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}renormalization\\text{-}series\\text{-}operations} \\vdash \\operatorname{SeriesAdd}_\\epsilon(a,b)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle n,+\\!(\\langle a(n),b(n)\\rangle)\\rangle:n\\in\\mathbb Z\\}\\land\\operatorname{SeriesNeg}_\\epsilon(a)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle n,c\\rangle\\in\\mathbb Z\\times A:+\\!(\\langle a(n),c\\rangle)=0_A\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}renormalization\\text{-}series\\text{-}operations} \\vdash \\operatorname{SeriesAdd}_\\epsilon(a,b)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle n,+\\!(\\langle a(n),b(n)\\rangle)\\rangle:n\\in\\mathbb Z\\}\\land\\operatorname{SeriesNeg}_\\epsilon(a)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle n,c\\rangle\\in\\mathbb Z\\times A:+\\!(\\langle a(n),c\\rangle)=0_A\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}renormalization\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}subtraction} \\vdash \\operatorname{MinimalSubtraction}_S(F,F_{\\mathrm{ren}};A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A,\\epsilon)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A)\\land F\\in\\operatorname{Laurent}_S(A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A;\\epsilon)\\land F_{\\mathrm{ren}}=\\operatorname{FinitePart}_\\epsilon(F)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}renormalization\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}subtraction} \\vdash \\operatorname{MinimalSubtraction}_S(F,F_{\\mathrm{ren}};A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A,\\epsilon)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A)\\land F\\in\\operatorname{Laurent}_S(A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A;\\epsilon)\\land F_{\\mathrm{ren}}=\\operatorname{FinitePart}_\\epsilon(F)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}renormalization\\text{-}counterterm} \\vdash \\operatorname{CountertermRenormalized}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{reg}},\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ct}},\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ren}};A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A,\\epsilon)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A)\\land\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{reg}}\\in\\operatorname{Laurent}_S(A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A;\\epsilon)\\land\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ct}}=\\operatorname{SeriesNeg}_\\epsilon(\\operatorname{PolePart}_\\epsilon(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{reg}}))\\land\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ren}}=\\operatorname{FinitePart}_\\epsilon(\\operatorname{SeriesAdd}_\\epsilon(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{reg}},\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ct}}))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}renormalization\\text{-}counterterm} \\vdash \\operatorname{CountertermRenormalized}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{reg}},\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ct}},\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ren}};A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A,\\epsilon)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A)\\land\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{reg}}\\in\\operatorname{Laurent}_S(A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A;\\epsilon)\\land\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ct}}=\\operatorname{SeriesNeg}_\\epsilon(\\operatorname{PolePart}_\\epsilon(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{reg}}))\\land\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ren}}=\\operatorname{FinitePart}_\\epsilon(\\operatorname{SeriesAdd}_\\epsilon(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{reg}},\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ct}}))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This atom defines the minimal-subtraction scheme for Laurent-regularized expressions; it does not claim that every renormalization procedure is pole subtraction.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-divergences</code> concerns statistical divergences and is not a source for ultraviolet divergences.</li>\n<li>BPHZ: BogoIibov-Parasiuk-Hepp-Zimmermann; recursive subtraction of Feynman diagram subdivergences</li>\n<li>Wilson: RG flow connects short/long distances; relevant/marginal/irrelevant operators</li>\n<li>Renormalization group: trajectories in space of QFTs under scale transformation</li>\n<li>Laurent series are now actual set functions <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Z\\to A\">\\(\\mathbb Z\\to A\\)</span> with lower-bounded support; pole extraction, series addition, and additive inversion are set-coded operators rather than meta-level formal sums.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Peskin and Schroeder, An Introduction to Quantum Field Theory</li>\n<li>Zinn-Justin, Quantum Field Theory and Critical Phenomena</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-ring","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ring]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ring","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ and $\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A)$ (see [[58-df-ring]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,+,\\cdot,0_A,1_A,\\epsilon,F,F_{\\mathrm{ren}},\\mathcal L_{\\math